# @exegia/corpora-ui is published to BOTH public npm and GitHub Packages.
# Resolve it from public npm so CI and Vercel need no credentials — a developer
# whose ~/.npmrc maps @exegia to npm.pkg.github.com would otherwise bake
# authenticated GitHub Packages URLs into bun.lock, and every build without a
# read:packages token fails with 401.
#
# Contains no token. Keep it that way.
@exegia:registry=https://registry.npmjs.org/
